  "interpretation": "Candidate quality is the actual query_key_value readout only. exact_key_value is a mixture diagnostic and is never an upper bound. The oracle gate is answerable-fact recoverability: raw valid top-1 on kind=fact divided by fact_n; unknown and revoked cases have separate abstention and false-recall rates and never enter that denominator. The total-group raw top-1 rate is descriptive only, and zero or tied readouts receive no recoverability or acceptance credit. Phase-scoped replay validates exact subset coverage, recomputes subset units and keeps the pinned parent inventory hash. Missing, duplicate, extra or out-of-declared-scope rows fail closed. Raw rows remain immutable and v1/v2/v3 receipts are never silently accepted as v4."
